  "description": "Hope you didn't get shaken out last week!",
  "body_html": "<p>There are times when I look at a stock, or the overall market and say: this is cooked 🍳. For all my fellow elder millennials and Gen X’ers, cooked = finished, doomed. </p><p>That was <strong>not</strong> the last week. The Russell 2000 just broke all time highs and the S&amp;P 500 is recovering locally. </p><p>Could it all collapse later? Sure. Possible. But I am not seeing signs of that. In fact, many individual names look incredibly strong… 2 of which I am targeting to ADD to our winning positions. More on that down below. </p><p>I know most attention is on Space X right now. I have kept my thoughts brief, intentionally, on this. If you want to gamble…have fun! But from a consistent, strategic investment strategy, this stock is a hard avoid. Here are my two previous notes about Space X…and you can also watch the video. </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/is-spacex-ipo-a-buy\">Is Space X IPO a Buy?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-272816215?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">My Space X Prediction: It Will Behave Like Palantir</a></p></li></ul><p>Also, a quick update on the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">Stocktok ETF</a>, the S&amp;P 500 caught up for a few days..but during the drop, our stocks just decided to quietly climb up. Now that momentum has returned, they are full on sprinting away from the S&amp;P. This was created for longer term investors who just want to “set it and forget it.” Most of the stocks still look great to buy. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-d3D!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-d3D!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-d3D!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-d3D!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-d3D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-d3D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1316\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1316,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:234665,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/201755292?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff98bfb97-7929-4d63-83dd-bbe5e1fffc3c_1766x1596.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&q