aft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>As always, questions are welcome in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/62da8ba2-2ee4-4ada-a814-5684bf31f23a\">Main Chat</a> during market hours. </p><p>Please like ❤️ and re-stack this post to help get past the AI Slop! </p><h4><strong>Now, the 2 stocks I am targeting to ADD to: </strong></h4>",
